    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970408.0176\n\nSINGAPORE, April 8 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nSingapore blue chips end 0.8 percent higher\n\n\n\n\nSingapore blue-chip share prices closed 0.8 percent higher Tuesday as market sentiment improved following a mild overnight rally by US stocks, dealers said.\n\nThe Straits Times Industrials index of leading shares on the Stock Exchange of Singapore rose 16.57 points to 2,104.71.",
